<title>GREECE: Attica Enterp H1 profit jumps 51 pct.</title>
<headline>Attica Enterp H1 profit jumps 51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek shipper Attica Enterprises said in a statement that its first-half consolidated profit surged 50.9 percent to 1.62 billion drachmas from 1.07 billion in the first half a year earlier.</p>
<p>First-half turnover rose 20.2 percent to 6.81 billion drachmas from 5.66 billion in the same period in 1996.</p>
</text>
